//! What a surface is drawn with, point by point as a shader asks: patterns
//! (grids, courses of bricks and boards, panels, openings in a cell, lines
//! and stripes filtered over a pixel), the ways a pattern is laid on a
//! surface (three planes, the face it is on, parallax, a room behind a
//! window), and layers blended by height and normals bent and joined.
package texture@1 { language = 1; ir = 1; }

use "kernels/";
